  m_text: "Self-organisation\n- Organising and structuring internal processes.\n\nSelf-regulation\n-
    Monitoring and adjusting actions.\n\nSelf-adaptation\n- Modifying behaviour,
    strategies, or decision-making processes. \n\nSelf-optimisation\n- Continuous
    improvement through learning and understanding how to modify behaviour.\n\nSelf-determination\n-
    Setting your own objectives and priorities."
